== width 80 ==
● <d>•</> first item
    <d>◦</> nested item that is long enough to wrap at a narrow width
      <d>◦</> third level
  <d>•</> second item

  <d>3.</> three
  <d>4.</> four
  <d>5.</> ten

  <d>1)</> paren marker
  <d>2)</> second

  <d>•</> loose item one

  <d>•</> loose item two
